{"id":"heat","en":["heat","heat (q)"],"target":"varmi","competitors":[],"sense":"thermal-energy","senses":[{"id":"thermal-energy","gloss":"heat as a noun: thermal energy transferred between bodies, a quantity of heat (heat flows, heat is absorbed, how much heat)"},{"id":"verb-to-heat","gloss":"heat as a verb: to warm or raise the temperature of something (heat the house, heat 1 kg of water, a heater heats)"}]},
